---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
export const prerender = false;

const organizatori = [
  { nume: "Deloiu Florin", telefon: "40746370722" }, // Înlocuiește cu numerele reale
  { nume: "Ioviță Lucian", telefon: "40741762711" },
  { nume: "Apetroaei Cezar", telefon: "40774005451" },
];

const linkInvitatieWhatsAppGrup =
  "https://chat.whatsapp.com/DYVYICECUZO47kOmp2D7up";

const googleMapsEmbedUrl =
  "https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2712.634062684668!2d27.60597687689485!3d47.16019862115091!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x40cafc75c2a0809d%3A0x46027052a10136a6!2sMagic%20Sport%20Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sro!4v1715159463021!5m2!1sen!2sro";
---

<Layout title="Despre Galero Football Iași">
  <style>
    .section-card {
      @apply bg-white shadow-xl rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out hover:shadow-2xl;
    }
    .btn {
      @apply px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      @apply bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 transform hover:scale-105;
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      @apply bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 transform hover:scale-105;
    }
    .btn-whatsapp {
      @apply bg-whatsapp hover:bg-whatsapp-dark flex items-center justify-center space-x-2;
    }
    .icon {
      @apply w-6 h-6 inline-block mr-2;
    }
  </style>

  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br min-h-screen py-8 md:py-12 px-4">
    <header class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <img
        src="/images/galero.jpg"
        alt="Galero Football Logo"
        class="mx-auto h-24 md:h-32 mb-4"
      />
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-sky-400 to-indigo-500 mb-3"
      >
        Fotbal Galero Iași
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-sky-600">
        Pasiune pentru fotbal, prietenie și voie bună!
      </p>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-10 md:space-y-12">
      <section
        class="section-card grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 items-center"
      >
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
            Când și Unde?
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
            <p class="flex items-center">
              <svg
                class="icon text-blue-500"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                ><path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M6 2a1 1 0 00-1 1v1H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2h-1V3a1 1 0 10-2 0v1H7V3a1 1 0 00-1-1zm0 5a1 1 0 000 2h8a1 1 0 100-2H6z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
              >
              <strong>Sâmbăta:</strong> 20:00 – 22:00
            </p>
            <p class="flex items-center">
              <svg
                class="icon text-red-500"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                ><path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M5.05 4.05a7 7 0 119.9 9.9L10 18.9l-4.95-4.95a7 7 0 010-9.9zM10 11a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
              >
              <strong>Locație:</strong> Terenul Magic Sport Center, Tudor Vladimirescu,
              Iași
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="h-64 md:h-80 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full border-0"
            src={googleMapsEmbedUrl}
            allowfullscreen=""
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-card text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
          Spiritul Galero
        </h2>
        <img
          src="/images/team-organizers.jpg"
          alt="Echipa Galero Football"
          class="mx-auto rounded-lg shadow-md mb-6 w-full max-w-md h-auto object-cover max-h-72"
        />
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          La Galero Football, nu este vorba doar despre a alerga după o minge.
          Este despre camaraderie, respect reciproc și bucuria de a petrece timp
          de calitate împreună. Fiecare meci este o ocazie de a ne depăși
          limitele, de a ne încuraja și, cel mai important, de a ne distra.
          Suntem un grup unit, primitor și mereu gata pentru o miuță ca la
          carte!
        </p>
      </section>

      <section
        class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-emerald-600 text-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-lg shadow-xl text-center"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-3">Vino în Echipă!</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-lg">
          Ești gata să ni te alături pe teren? Intră în grupul nostru de
          WhatsApp pentru a fi la curent cu organizarea meciurilor și discuțiile
          echipei!
        </p>
        <a
          href={linkInvitatieWhatsAppGrup}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn bg-green-600 text-white hover:bg-green-700 hover:bg-gray-100 transform hover:scale-105 inline-flex items-center"
        >
          <svg
            class="icon fill-current"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              d="M20.52,3.48A11.91,11.91,0,0,0,12,0h0A12,12,0,0,0,0,12v0a12,12,0,0,0,12,12h0a12,12,0,0,0,10.34-5.93A.61.61,0,0,0,22,17.39l0,0L21.52,14a.62.62,0,0,0-.54-.46H18.3a.62.62,0,0,0-.61.62v1a7.1,7.1,0,0,1-6.82,5.27A7.23,7.23,0,0,1,3.64,12a7.23,7.23,0,0,1,7.23-7.23A7.1,7.1,0,0,1,18.1,10v1a.62.62,0,0,0,.61.62h2.68a.62.62,0,0,0,.54-.46L22.45,8.2a.61.61,0,0,0-.28-.73A11.91,11.91,0,0,0,20.52,3.48ZM12,8.47A3.53,3.53,0,1,0,15.53,12,3.53,3.53,0,0,0,12,8.47Z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          Alătură-te Grupului WhatsApp
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="section-card">
        <h2
          class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 text-center"
        >
          🧑‍💼 Organizatorii Noștri Dedicați
        </h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {
            organizatori.map((org) => (
              <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-md text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300">
                <img
                  src={`https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=${org.nume.replace(" ", "+")}&background=random&color=fff&size=96`}
                  alt={org.nume}
                  class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full mx-auto mb-3 border-4 border-white shadow-sm"
                />
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700">{org.nume}</h3>
                <a
                  href={`https://wa.me/${org.telefon}?text=${encodeURIComponent(`Salut ${org.nume.split(" ")[1]}, aș dori mai multe detalii despre competiția de fotbal Galero.`)}`}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-green-600 hover:text-green-700 font-medium"
                >
                  Contactează pe WhatsApp
                </a>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>

      <section
        class="section-card bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-400 to-amber-500 text-white"
      >
        <div class="text-center">
          <img
            src="/images/galero.jpg"
            alt="Galero Logo"
            class="h-16 md:h-20 mx-auto mb-4"
          />
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-3">
          🎁 Sponsorul Nostru de Suflet
        </h2>
        <p class="text-center leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          O mulțumire specială lui <strong>Ioviță Lucian</strong> și firmei sale
          de cadouri personalizate,
          <a
            href="https://galero.ro"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-bold underline hover:text-yellow-100">Galero.ro</a
          >, pentru sprijinul constant. Datorită generozității lor, meciurile
          noastre sunt posibile și mai antrenante!
        </p>
        <div class="text-center mt-6">
          <a
            href="https://galero.ro"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn bg-yellow-600 text-white hover:bg-yellow-700"
          >
            Vizitează Galero.ro
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-card">
        <h2
          class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 text-center"
        >
          📸 Galerie Foto: Momente de Neuitat
        </h2>
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6"
        >
          {
            [
              {
                src: "/images/fotbal1.jpg",
                alt: "Acțiune pe teren Galero Football",
              },
              {
                src: "/images/fotbal2.jpg",
                alt: "Echipa Galero în timpul meciului",
              },
              {
                src: "/images/fotbal3.jpg",
                alt: "Bucurie după gol Galero Football",
              },
            ].map((img) => (
              <div class="aspect-w-4 aspect-h-3 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300">
                <img
                  src={img.src}
                  alt={img.alt}
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
